---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Services | CtrlBuild Technologies"
  description="Explore the software engineering and digital solution services offered by CtrlBuild Technologies."
>
 <main>
    <section class="cb-page-hero">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ SERVICES</p>

        <h1>
          We build the <span>technology</span> your business needs.
        </h1>

        <p class="cb-page-hero__intro">
          From custom business systems to web applications, mobile products
          and intelligent digital solutions, we design and engineer software
          around the way your organisation actually works.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cb-services-list">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <div class="cb-service">
          <span class="cb-service__number">01</span>

          <div class="cb-service__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">SOFTWARE ENGINEERING</p>
            <h2>Custom software systems</h2>
            <p>
              Purpose-built software for organisations whose processes cannot
              be adequately served by off-the-shelf tools.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Business management systems</li>
              <li>Operational platforms</li>
              <li>Workflow automation</li>
              <li>Internal tools and portals</li>
              <li>Database-driven applications</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-service">
          <span class="cb-service__number">02</span>

          <div class="cb-service__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">WEB DEVELOPMENT</p>
            <h2>Web applications & platforms</h2>
            <p>
              Fast, responsive and maintainable web applications designed for
              customers, teams and complex operational use cases.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Web applications</li>
              <li>Customer portals</li>
              <li>Dashboards</li>
              <li>Multi-tenant platforms</li>
              <li>Progressive web applications</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-service">
          <span class="cb-service__number">03</span>

          <div class="cb-service__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">MOBILE DEVELOPMENT</p>
            <h2>Mobile products</h2>
            <p>
              Mobile experiences that put useful products, services and
              business capabilities directly in the hands of users.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Android applications</li>
              <li>Cross-platform applications</li>
              <li>Mobile-first product experiences</li>
              <li>API-connected applications</li>
              <li>Offline-capable workflows</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-service">
          <span class="cb-service__number">04</span>

          <div class="cb-service__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">AI & INTELLIGENCE</p>
            <h2>AI-powered solutions</h2>
            <p>
              Practical applications of artificial intelligence that improve
              workflows, surface information and extend what software can do.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>AI-assisted workflows</li>
              <li>Intelligent search</li>
              <li>Content and document processing</li>
              <li>AI integrations</li>
              <li>Data-driven automation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-service">
          <span class="cb-service__number">05</span>

          <div class="cb-service__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">DATA & ANALYTICS</p>
            <h2>Analytics & business intelligence</h2>
            <p>
              Turn operational data into useful information through reporting,
              dashboards and systems that make important signals easier to see.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Business dashboards</li>
              <li>Reporting systems</li>
              <li>Data visualisation</li>
              <li>Performance tracking</li>
              <li>Analytics integrations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-service">
          <span class="cb-service__number">06</span>

          <div class="cb-service__content">
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">INTEGRATION & AUTOMATION</p>
            <h2>Connected digital systems</h2>
            <p>
              Connect the tools your organisation already uses and automate
              the movement of information between them.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>API development</li>
              <li>Third-party integrations</li>
              <li>Payment integrations</li>
              <li>System synchronisation</li>
              <li>Workflow automation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cb-services-cta">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <div class="cb-services-cta__panel">
          <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ HAVE A PROJECT?</p>
          <h2>Let's build something that <span>works.</span></h2>
          <p>
            Tell us what you need, what is currently getting in the way, or
            what you want to build from scratch.
          </p>

          <a href="/contact/">
            Start a conversation
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .cb-page-hero {
    padding: 9rem 0 7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-page-hero h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .cb-page-hero h1 span {
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
  }

  .cb-page-hero__intro {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .cb-services-list {
    padding: 2rem 0 0;
  }

  .cb-service {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-service__number {
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-service__content {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .cb-service__content h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .cb-service__content > p:not(.cb-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-service__content ul {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem 2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .cb-service__content li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .cb-service__content li::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.55em;
    left: 0;
    width: 0.3rem;
    height: 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-brand-coral);
    content: '';
  }

  .cb-services-cta {
    padding: 8rem 0;
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel h2 {
    max-width: 13ch;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.97;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel h2 span {
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel > p:not(.cb-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel a span {
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .cb-services-cta__panel a:hover span {
    transform: translate(3px, -3px);
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .cb-page-hero {
      padding: 11rem 0 8rem;
    }

    .cb-service {
      grid-template-columns: 5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }

    .cb-services-cta__panel {
      padding: 6rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cb-page-hero {
      padding: 7rem 0 5rem;
    }

    .cb-service__content ul {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cb-services-cta {
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cb-services-cta__panel a span {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
